prompt
Now I would like to test this procure for HCL. In this case, we do not have MARVEL data in the form of the Duo fitting input. Instead I suggest using the Exomol states file energies 1H-35Cl__HITRAN-HCl.states 
The QNs in this file are in two columns: 
       1     0.000000      8       0       0
       2  2885.976400      8       0       1
       3  5667.982976      8       0       2
col 4 is J
col 5 is v. 
This is sufficient for HCL, X1Sigma+:
parity = e 
State X 
Lambda=Sigma=Omega=0
For Weights I suggest 100/sqrt(v+1)/sqrt(J+1)
and also use Robust 0.0001 
Can you apply the developed scripts to HCl from the repository? Let me know if you need any extra instructions or information.


